menu "tinysctp (SCTP over UDP)"

    config TINYSCTP_MAX_STREAMS
        int "Streams each way, at most"
        default 8
        range 1 1024
        help
            An association gets min(this, what each end asks for). Each costs 4 bytes.

    config TINYSCTP_RX_WINDOW
        int "Receive window, in chunks"
        default 64
        range 8 4096
        help
            DATA chunks held for reordering or reassembly; more arriving past it are
            dropped and sent again by the peer. 20 bytes each, plus the data held.

    config TINYSCTP_TASK_STACK
        int "Stack of the association's task (bytes)"
        default 4096

    config TINYSCTP_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Priority of the association's task"
        default 8
        range 1 24

endmenu
